{"4302440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unmixable Syrup", "steam_appid": 4302440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unmixable Syrup&quot; is a retro-style walking simulator that has you wandering through dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/b528f9d13a783077b537efb206a5a048.poster.avif?t=1788231191\" width=656 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/b528f9d13a783077b537efb206a5a048.webm?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/b528f9d13a783077b537efb206a5a048.mp4?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore several small, quirky stages, idly flipping through snippets of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/481262108f53750a98246a0266399e17.poster.avif?t=1788231191\" width=656 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/481262108f53750a98246a0266399e17.webm?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/481262108f53750a98246a0266399e17.mp4?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a pulpy dream—neither help nor hindrance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/fca7ba72273b9f39dc691e7d054cddba.poster.avif?t=1788231191\" width=656 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/fca7ba72273b9f39dc691e7d054cddba.webm?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/fca7ba72273b9f39dc691e7d054cddba.mp4?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every stage, Dreamkeepers have lost their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/6bdb7896360c026a551a1e46d056a115.poster.avif?t=1788231191\" width=656 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/6bdb7896360c026a551a1e46d056a115.webm?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/6bdb7896360c026a551a1e46d056a115.mp4?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek them out and guide them to the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/bf7df3ee73a7ba7145f0f8ce79bb088f.poster.avif?t=1788231191\" width=656 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/bf7df3ee73a7ba7145f0f8ce79bb088f.webm?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302440/extras/bf7df3ee73a7ba7145f0f8ce79bb088f.mp4?t=1788231191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp